uted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511340/extras/ee37829c251fc8a9f21ec86de965faf7.poster.avif?t=1742578631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511340/extras/ee37829c251fc8a9f21ec86de965faf7.webm?t=1742578631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful 2D art</h2>From animations &amp; UI, diverse locations, appealing visuals of bosses, to design of enemies and skills - everything is colorful and pleasant. But don't let your guard down! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511340/extras/4fdabae2adcf0239aeae2975fca1f01b.poster.avif?t=1742578631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511340/extras/4fdabae2adcf0239aeae2975fca1f01b.webm?t=1742578631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
